---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /404.html
title: "Page not found"
description: "The page you're looking for doesn't exist. Browse the sections below to find what you need."
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---

<section class="container hero" style="padding-block: var(--s-8);">
  <p class="hero__eyebrow">404</p>
  <h1 class="hero__title" style="max-width: 22ch;">This page doesn't exist.</h1>
  <p class="hero__lede">
    The URL you tried may have been moved, mistyped, or never existed.
    Head back to the home page or pick a section below.
  </p>

  <div class="cta-row" role="list">
    <a class="cta" href="/" role="listitem">
      <span class="cta__icon cta__icon--primary" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M3 11.5L12 4l9 7.5"/><path d="M5 10v10h14V10"/>
        </svg>
      </span>
      <span class="cta__text">
        <span class="cta__title">Home</span>
        <span class="cta__sub">Start over →</span>
      </span>
    </a>
    {% for s in sections %}
    <a class="cta" href="{{ s.url }}" role="listitem">
      <span class="cta__icon cta__icon--{{ s.accent }}" aria-hidden="true">
        {% if s.icon == "schema" %}
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/>
            <rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/>
          </svg>
        {% elif s.icon == "parse" %}
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"/><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"/>
          </svg>
        {% else %}
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><polygon points="16.24 7.76 14.12 14.12 7.76 16.24 9.88 9.88 16.24 7.76"/>
          </svg>
        {% endif %}
      </span>
      <span class="cta__text">
        <span class="cta__title">{{ s.short }}</span>
        <span class="cta__sub">Browse section →</span>
      </span>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
